## Experience and Lessons
|Case|:add_to_cart  
Failure/Error Analysis1: Test expects redirect to `/cart` but `/add_to_cart` redirects to `/products`.  
Improvement Guidance1: Modify `main.py` to redirect to `/cart` after adding an item (if UX requires immediate cart view).  
Failure/Error Analysis2: After adding to cart, the page redirects to `/cart` instead of staying on `/products`.  
Improvement Guidance2: After adding an item, redirect back to `/products` instead of rendering `cart.html`.  
Code Fix:  
```python
@app.route('/cart', methods=['POST'])
def cart_post():
    if 'add' in request.form:
        product_id = request.form['product_id']
        cart_manager.add_to_cart(username, product_id)
        return redirect(url_for('products'))  # Fix: Redirect to products
```  

2. |Case|:remove_from_cart  
Failure/Error Analysis1: Cart item count does not decrease after removal.  
Improvement Guidance1: Ensure `CartManager.remove_item()` properly updates `carts.txt` before reloading.  
Failure/Error Analysis2: `NoSuchElementException` (View Cart link missing).  
Improvement Guidance2: Implement proper session cleanup after cart removal.  

