## Experience and Lessons
|Case|:checkout_process  
Failure/Error Analysis1: Timeout waiting for checkout page.  
Improvement Guidance1: Ensure `/checkout` route is accessible (no server-side blocking).  
Failure/Error Analysis2: Checkout form fields (`address`, `city`, `country`) not found.  
Improvement Guidance2: Verify `checkout.html` is properly loaded before form submission.  
Debug Steps:  
